# Figma Make Prompts: All Pages of the Online Examination Portal

**How to use:** paste **Prompt 0** first and let it finish. Then paste ONE page prompt per message, in the order below. After each page, check it, then continue. If a page drifts from the design system, reply: "Match the design system exactly; no new colors or components."

Pages marked ★ are the must-have pages for your demo. Build those first.

