## PROMPT 0: Design system (send first)

```
Use the existing "InterviewReady" exam page as the visual base for a new product:
"KLE Exam Portal", the online examination system of KLE Technological University.
Three roles: Student, Faculty, COE (Controller of Examinations).

DESIGN SYSTEM (use only this, no new colors)
- Background: cream-white #F6F9F6; cards white, 12px radius, 1px #E2E8E4 border, very light shadow.
- Primary: deep green #1F4D3F (buttons, active nav, links). Primary tint mint #D6EBDD.
- Text #10251F, muted #5B6B66 (never lighter). Min font 12px. Font: same as the existing page; monospace ONLY for exam codes, timestamps, IDs.
- Amber #B45309 on #FEF3C7 = warning / marked / needs action.
- Red #B91C1C on #FEE2E2 = error / last 2 minutes / critical. Green #15803D on #DCFCE7 = success.
- Status colors appear only as small chips, dots, or thin borders. Never as full card backgrounds.
- One primary (filled green) button per screen. Secondary = white with green outline. Ghost = text only. Destructive = red outline.
- 8px spacing grid, 24px page padding, content max-width 1200px, 44px minimum touch targets.
- Icons: line icons only (lucide style). No emoji. No gradients. No stock photos.

SHARED COMPONENTS to build once and reuse everywhere:
TopBar, SideNav (faculty/COE), StatusChip, Card, StatCard, DataTable (sortable header, filter bar,
pagination, row actions, empty/loading/error states), Tabs (underline), Stepper (horizontal),
Timer (green >10min, amber <10min, red <2min), QuestionPalette (Answered green-tint, Not answered
white outline, Not visited grey, Marked amber, Current dark green), ProctorTile (small camera
thumbnail with red recording dot), Dialog, Toast, Banner (info/warning/error), EmptyState,
FormField, FileUpload, Avatar, Breadcrumb, ProgressBar, Timeline.

GLOBAL RULES
- Every consequential action (submit exam, publish results, approve, rollback) opens a confirm Dialog.
- Every list page has: loading skeleton, empty state, error state.
- Integrity wording is non-punitive: "Needs review", "Faculty decision required". Never "Cheating" or "Disqualified".
- Show a thin amber banner "DEMO DATA" at the very top of every page.
- Responsive: student pages work at 360px; faculty/COE pages at 768px and up.
- Accessible: visible focus rings, AA contrast, labels on all inputs.
Create a "Design System" page showing all components and states. Do not build other pages yet.
```

